# --- IFCT 2017 food data (ICMR-NIN; licensed for PERSONAL USE, not redistribution) ---
# IFCT 2017 is personal-use licensed (no written NIN permission to redistribute yet), so its
# bulk extraction must NEVER be committed now that this repo is PUBLIC. These modules stay on
# disk for local full-library builds; the public bundle (mobile/assets/kb.json) is generated
# from the curated set with `scripts/export_kb.py --public`. The source PDF is never tracked.
rituva/ifct_local.py
rituva/recipes_local.py
ifct_*.json
IFCT*.pdf

